    "title": "Which former Redding Metro area high school athletes will be active on Saturday, Dec. 13?",
    "text": "These former Redding Metro high school stars set for games on Saturday, Dec. 13.\nBrody Lewis\nIdaho Yotes\nSenior\n6′4″ 290\nEtna Union High School\nHometown: Marysville\nNext Game: vs. Keiser Seahawks, Saturday, Dec. 13, 1 p.m.\nCade Cox\nUC Davis Aggies\nSenior\n6′0″ 175\nFoothill High School\nHometown: Redding\nNext Game: vs. Illinois State Redbirds, Saturday, Dec. 13, 2 p.m.\nDevin Huegel\nUC Davis Aggies\nFreshman\n6′4″ 275\nUniversity Preparatory School\nHometown: Redding\nNext Game: vs. Illinois State Redbirds, Saturday, Dec. 13, 2 p.m.\nZach Wilkes\nIdaho Yotes\nJunior\n6′1″ 185\nShasta High School\nHometown: Redding\nNext Game: vs. Keiser Seahawks, Saturday, Dec. 13, 1 p.m.",
